2026-09-09 03:32:06,579 [INFO]     closes same side of its open (same colour) AND same side of VWAP as the
2026-09-09 03:32:06,579 [INFO]     cross. Confirmation candle has NO body-size requirement (only the cross bar
2026-09-09 03:32:06,579 [INFO]     does). If wrong, adjust _vwap15_confirm_ok().
