2026-09-09 03:32:06,580 [INFO]     pivots > 20pt (price in clear space, not hugging a pivot). "cross" = bar
2026-09-09 03:32:06,580 [INFO]     open & close on opposite sides of VWAP. Pivots = classic floor-trader pivots
